    "handle": "lavendar-haze-soap-bar-60-gm",
    "title": "Lavendar Haze Soap Bar -60 gm",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"514\">Calm your senses and indulge your skin with our <strong data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"325\">Lavender Honeycomb Soap</strong>, a handcrafted cold process soap bar made with <strong data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"393\">pure coconut oil</strong> and naturally colored with <strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"437\">alkanet root</strong>. Its signature honeycomb design makes it as beautiful as it is nourishing.</p>\n<p data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"826\">Infused with <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"555\">lavender essential oil</strong>, this natural soap gently cleanses while leaving your skin soft, hydrated, and lightly scented with calming floral notes. The coconut oil base creates a rich, creamy lather that locks in moisture, making it an ideal daily soap for <strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"823\">dry, sensitive, or delicate skin</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1189\">✔ <strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"852\">Natural &amp; Handmade</strong> – Cold process soap made in small batches<br data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"897\">✔ <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"932\">Moisturizing Coconut Oil Base</strong> – Gentle on dry and sensitive skin<br data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"970\">✔ <strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"999\">Soothing Lavender Aroma</strong> – Perfect for relaxation and stress relief<br data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1045\">✔ <strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1080\">Naturally Tinted with Alkanet</strong> – Earthy tones without synthetic dyes<br data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1121\">✔ <strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1151\">Travel-Friendly 60g Size</strong> – Great for gifting or everyday use</p>\n<p data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1345\"><strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1205\">Skin Type:</strong> Suitable for all skin types, especially dry &amp; sensitive skin.<br data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1270\"><strong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1283\">Best For:</strong> Daily bathing, gifting, travel kits, and self-care rituals.</p>",
